    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>When you take a Magic action to place this magic quill beside @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPaper000000]{Paper} or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagParchment00]{Parchment} and a bottle of @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagInk00000000]{Ink} and speak its command word, the quill writes down the next words you speak or sign, in the language you use, at a pace of 25 words per minute. It keeps writing for 1 hour, until it runs out of Paper, Parchment, or Ink, or until you speak another command word to stop it (no action required).</p>",
